sparse cant see any of this.

> -	put_pid(xchg(&cad_pid, new_pid));
> +	old_pid = xchg(&cad_pid, new_pid);
> +	synchronize_rcu();
> +	put_pid(old_pid);

ok, fine. xchg() is fully ordered, one writer per old_pid, no double put.

